### Participantes com saldo
GET http://localhost:8082/participants

### Cadastrar um participante da sala
POST http://localhost:8082/participants
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Maria Souza", "pixKey": "maria", "balance": 1000.00}

### Caminho feliz: CREATED → DEBIT_PENDING → PIX_PENDING → COMPLETED
POST http://localhost:8081/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{"from": "ana", "to": "henrique", "amount": 150.00}

### Conta destino encerrada: PIX_PENDING → REFUNDING → CANCELLED
POST http://localhost:8081/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{"from": "ana", "to": "conta-encerrada", "amount": 150.00}

### Saldo insuficiente: DEBIT_PENDING → CANCELLED
POST http://localhost:8081/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{"from": "ana", "to": "henrique", "amount": 5000.00}

### Passo 2 · Escrita dupla: o send sai, o commit falha
POST http://localhost:8081/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
X-Simulate: CRASH_AFTER_SEND

{"from": "ana", "to": "henrique", "amount": 150.00}

### Consultar a transferência
GET http://localhost:8081/transfers/1042

### Por que a 1042 terminou assim? (saga_transitions)
GET http://localhost:8081/transfers/1042/transitions

### Extrato da transferência: débitos e estornos
GET http://localhost:8082/debits?transferId=1042

### Créditos do Pix da transferência
GET http://localhost:8083/pix?transferId=1042

### Passo 3 · O relay publica duas vezes (queda antes de marcar published_at)
POST http://localhost:8081/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
X-Simulate: DUPLICATE

{"from": "ana", "to": "henrique", "amount": 150.00}

### Passo 4 · Débito lento: debita na hora, responde 15 s depois
POST http://localhost:8081/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
X-Simulate: DEBIT_SLOW

{"from": "ana", "to": "henrique", "amount": 150.00}

### Passo 5 · Pix quebrado: o consumidor falha em toda tentativa
POST http://localhost:8081/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
X-Simulate: PIX_CRASH

{"from": "ana", "to": "henrique", "amount": 150.00}

### Passo 6 · SPI fora do ar por 15 s: o circuito abre e o consumidor pausa
POST http://localhost:8083/spi/outage?seconds=15

### Passo 6 · Estado do SPI e do circuito (CLOSED, OPEN, HALF_OPEN)
GET http://localhost:8083/spi

### Passo 6 · SPI de volta na hora
DELETE http://localhost:8083/spi/outage

### Passo 7 · Mortician: mensagens mortas da transferência
GET http://localhost:8084/dead-letters?transferId=1042

### Passo 7 · Investigar uma mensagem morta
GET http://localhost:8084/dead-letters/1

### Passo 7 · Resgatar: republica no tópico original, pela outbox
POST http://localhost:8084/dead-letters/1/republish
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "bug do PIX_CRASH corrigido no deploy", "requestedBy": "henrique"}

### Passo 8 · Sagas por estado (NEEDS_ATTENTION, DEBIT_UNKNOWN…)
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/metrics/saga.state?tag=state:NEEDS_ATTENTION

### Passo 8 · Mensagens que foram para a DLT
GET http://localhost:8083/actuator/metrics/saga.dlt.messages

### Passo 8 · Estado do circuit breaker do SPI
GET http://localhost:8083/actuator/circuitbreakers
